
# Telco Customer Churn Analysis

## Overview

This project analyzes customer churn in a telecommunications customer dataset using SQL and Power BI.

The main objective is to understand why customers leave, identify customer groups with higher churn risk, and understand which customers are most valuable to the business.

The analysis looks at customer characteristics, services, contracts, tenure, churn behavior, customer value, and risk.
SQL and Power BI are used to analyze and communicate the same business problem from different perspectives. 
SQL is used to explore the data and answer business questions, 
while Power BI is used to visualize the findings and communicate insights.

Analysis Stages
SQL Business Analysis
Power BI Dashboard
Deeper Analysis & Findings
Future: Python and Machine Learning

